ment-tax-return-sa100\">SA100 Tax Return</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This full version covers all the possible types of partnership income you might receive.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"related-forms-and-guidance\">Related forms and guidance</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Limit on Income Tax reliefs (Self Assessment helpsheet HS204)</a>. <br>\nFind out the total amount of certain Income Tax reliefs that can be used to reduce your total taxable income and complete your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The Self Assessment (partnership) (full) form and notes for the tax year 2025 to 2026 have been added. The forms and notes for tax year 2021 to 2022 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:15:20Z"},{"note":"The 'Partnership (full) notes (2025)' document has been updated.","public_timestamp":"2025-06-11T10:12:51Z"},{"note":"The Self Assessment (partnership) (full) form and notes for the tax year 2024 to 2025 have been added.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"note":"The Self Assessment (partnership) (full) form and notes for the tax year 2023 to 2024 have been added.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:15:17Z"},{"note":"Working sheets for 2021 to 2022 and 2022 to 2023 have been added and Welsh version of partnership form for 2022 to 2023 has been updated to replace incorrect version.","public_timestamp":"2023-08-14T11:43:37Z"},{"note":"The self-assessment (partnership) form and notes for the tax year 2022 to 2023 have been added.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:19Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2021 to 2022. The form and notes from tax year 2017 to 2018 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T23:15:17Z"},{"note":"The self-assessment (partnership) notes for the tax year 2020-21 have been added.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-05T23:15:28Z"},{"note":"The Partnership (full) form and notes have 